          "id": 603937966,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> whether the `event` argument is null, but later it dereferences `event` outside the conditional\n\nThat will lead to clang at least removing that check away.\n\nNull dereference for indirection is not undefined behaviour. https://wg21.cmeerw.net/cwg/issue232",
