        {
          "id": 1315432149,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": ">Calling event->button() on a null event is certainly UB.\n\nIt is neither defined, nor undefined, it is an open issue in the standard. It is defined to be an offset of. It returns the offset from the start of event structure to button() element.",
